# Cloudflare Pages routing for the Mangia SPA.
# 1) Strip trailing slashes so /shrewsbury/ becomes /shrewsbury — otherwise the
#    browser resolves relative asset/PDF links against the wrong folder.
/:slug/ /:slug 301
# 2) Serve index.html for any clean URL. Real files (assets, support.js,
#    sitemap, etc.) are served first; only unmatched paths like /shrewsbury
#    fall through to the app, which routes them.
/*    /index.html   200
